url: "https://github.com/kovariati/D-SCEOS"
abstract: >-
  Official simulation code and reproducibility package for D-SCEOS, a
  gateway-injected peer-to-peer control framework for resource-aware
  flexibility sharing in cyber-physical energy systems. The software
  implements dynamic aggregate and target estimation, graph-local
  optimization-guided control, capacity-normalized utilization sharing,
  CLF/HOCBF-QCQP operating-envelope handling, design-matched comparators,
  Monte Carlo and sensitivity studies, and independent solver cross-checks
  used in the associated published article.
